  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<p>Modifies the Lightkeeper questline:</p>\n<p>- Removes pre-requisite quests i.e unlocks the start of the questline <code>Network Provider - Part 1</code> at level 25 from Mechanic</p>\n<p>- Removes time-gating on quests</p>\n<p>Copy the extracted user folder to your SPTarkov installation</p>\n<p>Configuration is in user/mods/Oxide-LightkeeperQuestlinePatch/src/config.json.</p>\n<p><strong>skipTimeGate:</strong> setting true skips time gating for Mechanic &amp; Lightkeeper quests</p>\n<p><strong>removeRequirements:</strong> setting true skips requirements to start the questline (<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://tarkov.help/en/quest/lightkeeper-unlocking\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://tarkov.help/en/quest/lightkeeper-unlocking</a> for 3.8.3)</p>\n<p>Haven’t tested yet, might be incompatible with any quest overhaul or mods that change Lightkeeper quests. This mod changes the per-requisites for Network Provider - Part 1 and the startAfter time for all the quests in that chain after that point.</p>\n<p>Delete the Oxide-LightkeeperQuestlinePatch folder. Shouldn’t change anything for accepted quest(s) but will change the rest of the questline back to normal</p>\n",
